                            <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/ed602e_9d59715146b64749afd960598750818f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_753,h_846,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ed602e_9d59715146b64749afd960598750818f~mv2.jpeg" alt="Côte d'Ivoire">
