                        <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">
                            The Honorary Consulate of the Republic of Côte d'Ivoire in The Gambia serves as a point of contact for individuals, institutions and organisations seeking information and consular assistance relating to Côte d'Ivoire.
                            <br><br>
                            Through its work, the Consulate supports Ivorian nationals, provides guidance to people interested in travelling to or learning about Côte d'Ivoire, and encourages stronger economic, cultural and institutional relations between the two countries.
